{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## F18 completed\n\nCompletion verification passed all six F18 criteria with no findings and signed against `7fee4acbfa570b834b2bc917ce5febbc3e1b7862`. The normal transition returned `closed` with a signed completion record.\n\nThe transition initially encountered the transient tracker publication race recorded on `agrologic-oval-bobolink`. A serialized fetch followed by a rebar write recovered publication. The bug now contains the close-specific evidence and the observed backlog growth from 45 to 70 commits. No force option or raw tracker mutation was used."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787531553395312001,"uuid":"bd4417ae-88e7-41c3-b008-bb6ae159cc01"}